   488	  # backstop. `preflight.sh --landing` is the PREVENT gate at land time; this job
   489	  # is the DETECT gate for whatever slips it. Reuses
   490	  # scripts/check-c1-conformance.sh — the SAME script preflight calls — so the
   491	  # two homes cannot diverge (see that script's header for the predicate, for the
   492	  # five TC-37 evaporation paths, and for the explicit statement of what this
