   495	  # Deliberately carries NO `if:` condition and NO `needs:`, and is NOT on the
   496	  # docs_only fast path. That combination is the whole point of the job. The
   497	  # subject here straddles both fast paths: the ratified C-1 contract is a DESIGN
   498	  # DOC (so a code-only push would skip a docs_only-gated job) while the code it
   499	  # governs is SOURCE (so a docs-only push takes the fast path that skips the
   500	  # heavy verify job). Either gate would make this job absent on exactly the
   501	  # pushes that matter — a rename in src/ that breaks a contract obligation, or
   502	  # an edit to the contract that moves it out from under its clause registry.
